        "tārānāyaka-śekharāṃ smitamukhīm āpīna-vakṣoruhām ।",
        "pāṇibhyām ali-pūrṇa-ratna-caṣakaṃ raktotpalaṃ bibhratīṃ",
        "saumyāṃ ratnaghaṭastha-raktacaraṇāṃ dhyāyet parām ambikām ॥"
      ],
      "kannada": [
